  "description": "What if FERS and/or Social Security are not there? Baseline = corrected FERS (7/8, service 2023, base+market high-3) + SS at 70 for both spouses. FERS capped: leave the VA in 2028 with ~5 years of service, taking the ~$53k employee-contribution refund into the portfolio instead of a ~$580/mo deferred annuity (roughly value-equivalent; SS unaffected by leaving the VA). SS eliminated: both benefits zeroed (a ~23% trust-fund-style cut is interpolable between baseline and zero). Fixed: 2 kids public school, $5M legacy, no disability, house June 2027, savings +2.5%/yr real, PA.",
